OL,3,ACould this be the last Bonfire Night
OL,4,Afor noisy fireworks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBangers, rockets and screamers have
OL,7,Flong been part of Bonfire Night - but
OL,8,Fthe traditional celebrations might
OL,9,Fsound a little different next year.
OL,11,FThe government is currently considering
OL,12,Freducing the limit for the noisiest
OL,13,Ffireworks for private use by 50%, after
OL,14,Fpressure from campaigners concerned
OL,15,Fabout the impact on nervous animals and
OL,16,Fpeople with Post Traumatic Stress
OL,17,FDisorder (PTSD).
OL,19,FAbout 20 million people enjoy fireworks
OL,20,Fat home every year, according to
OL,21,Findustry figures.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
