OL,3,ACould this be the last Bonfire Night
OL,4,Afor noisy fireworks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Hubble, of the British Fireworks
OL,7,FAssociation (BFA), said displays had
OL,8,Falready been getting quieter and a
OL,9,Fbalance must be struck to prevent a
OL,10,Fblack market in noisy fireworks
OL,11,Fspringing up.
